    "en": {
      "text": "Weapon Kills grant additional Super Ability Energy. Equipping multiple Pale Heart Weapons increases the amount granted. \n\nExtra Super Energy gains with 1|2|3 equipped Pale Heart Weapons: 0.3%|1.6%|3%\n\nPale Heart Weapons include:\n• Weapons with the Dealer's Choice Origin Trait\n• Ace of Spades, Khvostov 7G-0X, and Still Hunt",
      "updatedAt": "2024-08-08T17:42:36.053Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
